---
// Meituan Leaf Double Buffer Segment Architecture Diagram Component
---

<figure class="leaf-diagram" aria-labelledby="leaf-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG layout (ViewBox 840x260, spacious padding, large legible fonts) -->
  <svg
    class="leaf-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 840 260"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="leaf-diagram-title leaf-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="leaf-diagram-title">
      美團 Leaf 雙 Buffer 非同步號段平滑切換架構
    </title>
    <desc id="leaf-diagram-desc">
      展示應用記憶體 Buffer 1 在消耗至 10%
      閾值時，喚醒背景執行緒非同步向資料庫批量獲取新號段寫入 Buffer 2；當 Buffer
      1 耗盡時，指標毫秒級切換，達成 100% 零阻塞與 DB 短暫當機容災。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="leaf-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="leaf-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="leaf-arrow-switch"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="7"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="6"
        markerHeight="6"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="leaf-diagram__arrow-head--switch"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Buffer 1 In Use (X: 20, Y: 30, Width: 380, Height: 190) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 30)">
      <rect
        width="380"
        height="190"
        rx="12"
        class="leaf-diagram__card leaf-diagram__card--green"></rect>
      <text class="leaf-diagram__badge leaf-diagram__badge--green" x="20" y="32"
        >MEMORY BUFFER 1 (ACTIVE)</text
      >
      <text class="leaf-diagram__title leaf-diagram__title--green" x="20" y="60"
        >目前使用中號段 (1001 ~ 2000)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 78)">
        <rect width="344" height="42" rx="6" class="leaf-diagram__subbox"
        ></rect>
        <text class="leaf-diagram__code" x="172" y="26" text-anchor="middle">
          AtomicLong.incrementAndGet() ➔ O(1) 極速取號
        </text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(20, 140)">
        <text class="leaf-diagram__desc" x="0" y="16"
          >• 剩餘 10% 閾值 (餘量 ≤ 100) ➔ 觸發非同步預載</text
        >
        <text class="leaf-diagram__highlight" x="0" y="38"
          >耗盡瞬間：記憶體指標極速原子切換！</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Async Loading Arrow (Buffer 1 -> Background DB Thread) -->
    <path
      d="M 400 75 H 445"
      class="leaf-diagram__connector leaf-diagram__connector--async"
      marker-end="url(#leaf-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="leaf-diagram__arrow-label" x="422" y="65" text-anchor="middle"
      >非同步喚醒</text
    >

    <!-- Column 2: Async Thread & DB -> Buffer 2 (X: 450, Y: 30, Width: 370, Height: 190) -->
    <g transform="translate(450, 30)">
      <rect
        width="370"
        height="190"
        rx="12"
        class="leaf-diagram__card leaf-diagram__card--purple"></rect>
      <text
        class="leaf-diagram__badge leaf-diagram__badge--purple"
        x="20"
        y="32">ASYNC PRELOAD ➔ BUFFER 2</text
      >
      <text
        class="leaf-diagram__title leaf-diagram__title--purple"
        x="20"
        y="60">非同步資料庫號段交互 (待命)</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 78)">
        <rect
          width="334"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox leaf-diagram__subbox--db"></rect>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__code leaf-diagram__code--db"
          x="167"
          y="26"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          UPDATE tbl SET max_id = max_id + 1000
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- Buffer 2 Ready State -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 130)">
        <rect
          width="334"
          height="42"
          rx="6"
          class="leaf-diagram__subbox leaf-diagram__subbox--ready"></rect>
        <text
          class="leaf-diagram__ready-text"
          x="167"
          y="26"
          text-anchor="middle"
        >
          Buffer 2 載入就緒 (2001 ~ 3000)・零阻塞待命
        </text>
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Switch Pointer Curved Arrow (Buffer 2 -> Buffer 1) -->
    <path
      d="M 450 170 C 425 185, 425 140, 405 155"
      class="leaf-diagram__connector leaf-diagram__connector--switch"
      marker-end="url(#leaf-arrow-switch)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile vertical layout -->
  <div class="leaf-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="leaf-mobile-card leaf-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="leaf-mobile-badge leaf-mobile-badge--green"
        >BUFFER 1 (ACTIVE)</span
      >
      <h4>記憶體號段 1：高頻讀取消耗中</h4>
      <p>
        應用層透過 AtomicLong 純記憶體操作發號，吞吐量突破百萬級；當號段消耗達
        90%（剩餘 10%）時，非同步喚醒背景執行緒。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-arrow">↓ 餘量 ≤ 10% 非同步喚醒預載</div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-card leaf-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="leaf-mobile-badge leaf-mobile-badge--purple"
        >ASYNC DB FETCH</span
      >
      <h4>非同步執行緒批次獲取新號段</h4>
      <p>
        背景執行緒單次 SQL I/O 向資料庫預先申請下一個號段（如
        2001~3000），並預載至備用 Buffer 2，完全不阻塞線上請求。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-arrow">↓ Buffer 1 耗盡瞬間</div>

    <div class="leaf-mobile-card leaf-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="leaf-mobile-badge leaf-mobile-badge--blue"
        >BUFFER 2 (HOT STANDBY)</span
      >
      <h4>Buffer 2 無縫接管發號</h4>
      <p>
        雙 Buffer 指標毫秒級原子切換，達成 100%
        零延遲抖動；即便底層資料庫短暫當機 10~30 分鐘，發號服務依然平穩運作。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="leaf-diagram-caption">
    圖：美團 Leaf 雙 Buffer 號段架構 —— 10%
    閾值非同步預載、零阻塞發號與資料庫容災
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .leaf-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Base Tokens */
  .leaf-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__card--green {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__card--green {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__card--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__card--purple {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__badge--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__badge--purple {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__badge--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title--green {
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__title--green {
    fill: #86efac;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__title--purple {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__title--purple {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox--db {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox--db {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
    fill: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
  }

  .leaf-diagram__subbox--ready {
    stroke: #3b82f6;
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.06);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__subbox--ready {
    stroke: #60a5fa;
    fill: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
  }

  .leaf-diagram__code {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .leaf-diagram__code--db {
    fill: #7c3aed;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__code--db {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__ready-text {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #2563eb;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__ready-text {
    fill: #93c5fd;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .leaf-diagram__highlight {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #15803d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__highlight {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__connector {
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__connector--async {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__connector--async {
    stroke: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #a78bfa;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__connector--switch {
    stroke: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__connector--switch {
    stroke: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--switch {
    fill: #16a34a;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__arrow-head--switch {
    fill: #4ade80;
  }

  .leaf-diagram__arrow-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #8b5cf6;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-diagram__arrow-label {
    fill: #c4b5fd;
  }

  figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Mobile Breakpoint (≤ 48rem / 768px) */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .leaf-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .leaf-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card--green {
      border-left: 4px solid #16a34a;
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-card--green {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.1);
      border-color: #4ade80;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-card--purple {
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
      border-color: #a78bfa;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-card--blue {
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
      border-color: #60a5fa;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #16a34a;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-badge--green {
      color: #86efac;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #8b5cf6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c4b5fd;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #3b82f6;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .leaf-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .leaf-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .leaf-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
